{"id":63543,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63543"},"modified":"2026-10-16T21:12:37","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T20:12:37","slug":"castanha-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/castanha-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), na freguesia de <strong>Brufe<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito de Braga). Com partida e chegada na \u00e1rea envolvente ao <strong>Centro Social de Brufe e Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos<\/strong> (local do paddock do evento), esta 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o integra oficialmente o <strong>Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, constituindo a segunda prova pontu\u00e1vel de 2026.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> com a <strong>Caminhada de 6 km<\/strong> (car\u00e1ter n\u00e3o competitivo, aberta a maiores de 12 anos), seguida \u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong> pela partida do <strong>Trail Curto (TC) de 14 km<\/strong> (tempo limite de 2h30, aberto a atletas dos 18 aos 80 anos). O percurso encontra-se sinalizado com placas e fitas laranja\/azul nos trilhos de Brufe e arredores, em regime de autossufici\u00eancia de recipiente de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o no abastecimento interm\u00e9dio, culminando num conv\u00edvio tradicional com castanhas e b\u00f4la fina.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Bicicletas Temos Todos BRUFEBTT<\/strong>, em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong> e a <strong>Freguesia de Brufe<\/strong>. O secretariado funciona na v\u00e9spera (s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, das 10h00 \u00e0s 19h00, na tenda da BRUFEBTT no recinto da Mostra Associativa de Brufe) e no dia da prova (domingo, das 08h00 \u00e0s 09h00, no paddock do evento).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Centro Social de Brufe e Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos, Brufe, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Trail Curto (14 km) e Caminhada (6 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=