 target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">7,50 \u20ac (at\u00e9 8 nov)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Curto<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">12,50 \u20ac (at\u00e9 8 nov)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida do 4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na \u00e1rea envolvente ao Centro Social de Brufe e Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos (41.411389, -8.538288), em Brufe, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Caminhada de aproximadamente 6 km parte \u00e0s 09:00 e o Trail Curto (TC) de aproximadamente 14 km parte \u00e0s 09:15, com tempo limite de prova de 2h30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e o prazo limite de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram no dia 8 de novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23h59, com o valor \u00fanico de 12,50 \u20ac para o Trail Curto (14 km) e 7,50 \u20ac para a Caminhada (6 km). Inclui dorsal, abastecimentos, banhos no local e, no caso do trail, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro e lembran\u00e7a finisher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais podem ser levantados no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro de 2026, das 10h00 \u00e0s 19h00, na tenda da equipa BRUFEBTT no recinto da Mostra Associativa de Brufe, ou no domingo, dia da prova, das 08h00 \u00e0s 09h00, no paddock do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios existem na prova de Trail Curto?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos da Geral Absoluta, por Equipas (M\/F) e nos escal\u00f5es Sub-23 (16-22), Seniores (23-34), M35\/F35, M40\/F40, M45\/F45, M50\/F50, M55\/F55 e M60+\/F60+. A prova pontua para o Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o 4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Bicicletas Temos Todos BRUFEBTT, em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com o Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o e a Freguesia de Brufe.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro Social de Brufe e Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos, Brufe, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Bicicletas Temos Todos BRUFEBTT\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida do 4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O 4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na \u00e1rea envolvente ao Centro Social de Brufe e Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos (41.411389, -8.538288), em Brufe, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Caminhada de aproximadamente 6 km parte \u00e0s 09:00 e o Trail Curto (TC) de aproximadamente 14 km parte \u00e0s 09:15, com tempo limite de prova de 2h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e o prazo limite de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram no dia 8 de novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23h59, com o valor \u00fanico de 12,50 \u20ac para o Trail Curto (14 km) e 7,50 \u20ac para a Caminhada (6 km). Inclui dorsal, abastecimentos, banhos no local e, no caso do trail, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro e lembran\u00e7a finisher.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os dorsais podem ser levantados no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro de 2026, das 10h00 \u00e0s 19h00, na tenda da equipa BRUFEBTT no recinto da Mostra Associativa de Brufe, ou no domingo, dia da prova, das 08h00 \u00e0s 09h00, no paddock do evento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios existem na prova de Trail Curto?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos da Geral Absoluta, por Equipas (M\/F) e nos escal\u00f5es Sub-23 (16-22), Seniores (23-34), M35\/F35, M40\/F40, M45\/F45, M50\/F50, M55\/F55 e M60+\/F60+. A prova pontua para o Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o 4\u00ba Da Castanha Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Bicicletas Temos Todos BRUFEBTT, em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com o Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o e a Freguesia de Brufe.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69691,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63543","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-famalicao-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-castanha-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63543","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{